              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless Steel grade 15-5 PH is a martensitic precipitation-hardening stainless steel with high strength and hardness, and exhibits excellent corrosion resistance. When compared with 17-4 PH, 15-5 PH demonstrates higher transvers toughness, ductility, better overall mechanical properties, and better forgeability. This alloy is strengthened significantly by a low temperature heat treatment and meets stringent requirements for aerospace and nuclear applications."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless Steel 15-5 PH Specifications:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[AMS 2300](https://titanium.com/ams-2300-specification/) , [AMS 5659 TYPE 1](https://titanium.com/ams-5659-specification/)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[ASTM A564 TYPE XM-12](https://titanium.com/astm-a564-specification/)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless Steel 15-5 PH products offered at all Titanium Industries’ locations:"
                },
